OL,3,GNEWSAHow a scientist used Britpop to
OL,4,Areach Mars
OL,5,
OL,6,FA series of plaques has been unveiled
OL,7,Facross the UK to celebrate the
OL,8,Fcountry's first spacecraft to reach
OL,9,Fanother planet.
OL,11,FYet the mastermind behind Beagle 2 was
OL,12,Fnever your typical rocket scientist.
OL,14,FWith his mutton-chop sideburns, West
OL,15,FCountry accent and infectious
OL,16,Fenthusiasm, Professor Colin Pillinger
OL,17,Fpersuaded politicians, pop stars and
OL,18,Fthe public to support what had seemed
OL,19,Fimpossible: a British mission to Mars.
